# The range guest under KAYA_LOCALE=ar-EG (docs/range-plan.md §3 rules 5 and
# 6, §5): the range mirrors as the slider does, so the low thumb sits at the
# right and its place, read from the LEFT, is the mirror of range.steps'; the
# vertical fader does not flip.
expect_value range#0 "2 8"
expect_thumb range#0 low "0.8"
expect_thumb range#0 high "0.2"
set_value range#0 low 3.2
expect_value range#0 "3 8"
expect label#1 "commits: 1 at 3 8"
expect_thumb range#0 low "0.7"
expect_thumb slider#1 "0.25"
expect_ax range#0 "group/Trim"
expect_ax range#0 low "slider/In"
expect_ax range#0 high "slider/Out"
